WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.660
17, no action letters end, putting event contract venues under one reporting rule. This is prediction market's daily, episode 63. Journalism and education never abet. After this, a Utah trading halt, a cluster of wallets timed to an Nvidia announcement, and why a plain average of forecast so often beats the clever mix, then the board. The Commodity Futures Trading Commission approved that final rule on Monday, fully collateralized event contracts now report under parts 15 through 18.

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:34.360
The future style books, and they stay outside the swap reports in parts 43 and 45.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:38.360
The letters being retired had carried those venues since 2017.

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:41.600
The preamble counts the scale underneath the change.

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:48.300
American exchanges listed about five event contracts a year from 2006 through 2020, then

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:51.500
certified roughly 1,600 in 2025.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:58.780
FM Intelligence puts Kalshi and Polly market together at $172.4 billion of volume in the

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:02.520
third quarter, up from $98.5 billion in the second.

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:07.900
Chairman Michael S. Selig said the agency will no longer regulate market participants through

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:13.520
a patchwork of no-action letters, which serve as band-aids for unworkable regulations, and

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:17.620
he called the rule an important step in future-proofing the framework for event contracts.

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:25.700
A position becomes reportable at $125,000 contracts, $125,000 of notional value.

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:29.040
The default for other commodities is 25 contracts.

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:34.520
Exchanges have to keep a trader's name, address, email, phone, occupation, and employer,

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:39.980
and the names of anyone holding 10% or more of the account for five years after the contract

00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:40.420
ends.

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:45.860
Kalshi had argued in its comment letter that margin-devent contracts share those features.

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:50.740
In March, it set out plans to offer margin trading through an affiliate, kinetic markets.

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:53.480
The commission refused to widen the definition.

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:57.320
Some duties start 60 days after the rule hits the federal register.

00:01:57.920 --> 00:02:02.660
Large trader provisions start on the later of that date, or July 26, 2027.

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:05.580
Trader identification data waits 12 months.

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:10.920
The same day, staff and market oversight and clearing and risk said Bitcoin, Ether and

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:15.720
payment stablecoins may count toward the reserve that covers 12 months of operating costs.

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:20.960
The minimum haircut they described is 20 percent on bitcoin and ether and 2 percent on

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:22.080
payment stablecoins.

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:27.160
Those assets still do not count toward the separate liquidity requirement, because under

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:30.920
U.S. accounting rules, they are neither cash nor highly liquid securities.

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:33.860
The advisory is a staff view, not a rule.

00:02:34.948 --> 00:02:37.808
CalShi has stopped letting people in Utah open new positions.

00:02:37.808 --> 00:02:43.808
More than 177 users are on the other side of that block, after a federal court allowed

00:02:43.808 --> 00:02:46.868
the state to enforce its gambling laws against the platform.

00:02:47.468 --> 00:02:53.228
Jackie McGavick, a company spokesperson, told the Salt Lake Tribune on November 23rd that

00:02:53.228 --> 00:02:57.048
Calche will keep fighting in court and means to come back if that fight succeeds.

00:02:57.768 --> 00:03:01.328
People who already hold contracts can close them and take their money out.

00:03:01.848 --> 00:03:04.048
The first screen used registration details.

00:03:04.608 --> 00:03:06.808
The company plans to follow that with GPS.

00:03:06.808 --> 00:03:10.288
Yes, Attorney General Derek Brown welcomed the halt on Monday.

00:03:10.928 --> 00:03:15.948
Gambling, he said, is barred by the state constitution, and his office will talk to prosecutors

00:03:15.948 --> 00:03:17.108
